  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d14ee6cd03d918b3",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2：一款开放、轻量级的多模态嵌入模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e9317540195bdc9",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2 是目前最强大的端侧多模态嵌入模型，能够原生将文本、图像、音频和视频的组合映射到一个统一的嵌入空间中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2bb49f93100beb3",
      "translationZh": "研究工程师，Google DeepMind",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 仍处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ca8e9909115133c",
      "translationZh": "我们去年推出了 EmbeddingGemma，旨在为高质量文本嵌入提供轻量化选择，帮助您的应用直接在消费级硬件上组织、搜索和连接信息。开发者社区的反响超出了我们的预期。凭借超过 2000 万次的下载量，构建者们已利用它来驱动更智能的端侧搜索工具和隐私优先的检索增强生成 (RAG) 流水线。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "724a93767d449a05",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出了 EmbeddingGemma 2，将其能力从文本扩展到统一代码、图像、视频和音频的共享嵌入空间。EmbeddingGemma 2 基于 Gemma 4 架构构建，并根据商业许可的 Apache 2.0 协议发布，拥有 7.4 亿个参数，是端侧推理的最佳选择。它可以帮助从语音备忘录中找到特定的视频片段，或者根据文本查询搜索数小时的音频录音，所有这些都由单个原生多模态模型完成处理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4ff832fa95210da",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2 基于与 Gemini Embedding 模型相同的技术构建，它是：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "28d33d4191d0492f",
      "translationZh": "同尺寸类别中的佼佼者：在 MTEB（大规模文本嵌入基准）Code 和 MAEB（大规模音频嵌入基准）等基准测试中，其在 1B 以下的多模态嵌入模型中取得了领先评分，同时在文本、视觉和音频任务上能够匹配或超越许多更大的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "853e5af927b11a87",
      "translationZh": "模块化设计：仅需 2.7 亿个参数即可处理纯文本工作负载，并提供可选的视觉（1.7 亿个参数）和音频（3 亿个参数）编码器以实现完整的多模态支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8890dbc79bcaf184",
      "translationZh": "存储高效：通过使用 Matryoshka 表示学习 (MRL)，开发人员可以将输出向量从 768 维动态截断为 512、256 或 128 维。这为本地向量数据库和内存使用提供了高达 6 倍的存储缩减。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b529ba6550cdd7c",
      "translationZh": "针对端侧性能进行了优化：在严苛的资源限制下仍能高效运行。通过量化技术，在 Google Pixel 11 Pro 上，EmbeddingGemma 2 处理纯文本权重仅需约 191MB 的活动内存，而完整的多模态模型仅需约 567MB。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdfa7ce195b06501",
      "translationZh": "支持扩展上下文：具备 8K token 的上下文窗口（比 EmbeddingGemma 1 大 4 倍），允许直接在本地硬件上处理长达 5.5 分钟的音频、29 张图像、58 帧视频或它们的交错组合。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5cae8f9960241bf2",
      "translationZh": "在代码、视觉和音频方面实现顶尖质量",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2143bf045a62544",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2 保持了 EmbeddingGemma 强大的多语言文本性能，同时在代码性能方面实现了 9.92 分的显著提升（在 MTEB Code 中从 68.76 提升至 78.68），使其非常适合本地代码库索引、语义代码搜索和编程智能体检索。在图像、视频、文档和音频方面，它为 1B 以下模型树立了新的参数质量标准，甚至超越了一些规模是其两倍以上的专业模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d3059e7b775b2d0",
      "translationZh": "请在 EmbeddingGemma 2 模型卡中查找完整的评估指标和模型信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "720d38b00f8fdc50",
      "translationZh": "启用语义搜索、路由和检索，完全在设备上",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be36e46cf63a136b",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2 将强大的功能直接带到边缘硬件。在本地生成嵌入有助于确保数据隐私，降低管道延迟，并使开发者能够构建完全离线工作的跨模态搜索和检索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "112f3be7b73063f9",
      "translationZh": "与 Gemma 4 等生成模型配对时，EmbeddingGemma 2 能够实现能够理解复杂多模态数据的设备端 RAG 流水线。由于 EmbeddingGemma 2 基于 Gemma 4 构建并共享其文本分词器和音频编码器，开发者可以在一个统一的流水线中同时运行这两个模型，从而降低总的内存占用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d730bc4e4a257053",
      "translationZh": "使用文本或图像在您的媒体库中基于语义相似性查找最匹配的结果。尝试在 Google AI Edge Gallery 的 Instant Media Search 中使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a7a151efc662d15",
      "translationZh": "使用文本或音频查询定位视频中的特定时刻。尝试在 Google AI Edge Gallery 的 Video Moments Finder 中使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d819a878a71e510",
      "translationZh": "将 EmbeddingGemma 2 与 Gemma 4 配对，分别用于本地文件检索和上下文推理。在 Google AI Edge Foresight 应用中尝试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b468126f27318fc5",
      "translationZh": "利用多模态上下文通过 MediaPipe Decision Task API 创建用于分类、路由和预测的实时决策引擎。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2dfd815e30c166e0",
      "translationZh": "要了解如何使用 LiteRT 构建设备端搜索和 RAG 系统，请阅读 Google AI Edge 博客文章。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "38eddfd97b83e6f9",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 EmbeddingGemma 2",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d679acd2938650c",
      "translationZh": "我们与以下合作伙伴紧密合作，以确保 EmbeddingGemma 2 在您的构建环境中能够立即投入使用：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6fb80529113b4aa8",
      "translationZh": "下载模型：在 Hugging Face 和 Kaggle 上查找模型权重，Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform Model Garden 也将很快提供。访问 Hugging Face 上的 LiteRT Community 以获取针对设备端优化的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "388c242aa35ba466",
      "translationZh": "设备端部署：使用 Google AI Edge MediaPipe 进行开箱即用的嵌入、检索和决策任务，或使用 LiteRT 进行自定义模型集成，从而开发跨平台应用。使用 transformers.js 或 WebGPU 进行浏览器端构建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2bb63db73e4b97be",
      "translationZh": "使用您喜爱的开发工具：使用 transformers、sentence-transformers、MLX、vLLM、llama.cpp、SGLang、Ollama 和 LMStudio 高效地提供模型服务。使用 Qdrant 存储您的嵌入向量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46bc282e1e655c1c",
      "translationZh": "微调：遵循 Unsloth 的指导，了解如何针对您的用例微调 EmbeddingGemma 2。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "305ef4c26522e174",
      "translationZh": "探索我们的开发者指南、文档以及推理和微调指南。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月宣布的最新 AI 新闻",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0427f9d1d93e63e6",
      "translationZh": "我们正在推出 SynthID Bio，将我们的水印技术引入合成生物学领域。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
